# ParkVision AI configuration reference - no secrets.
# FastAPI does not load this file automatically. In PowerShell use:
# $env:AUTH_ENABLED="1" before starting the backend (default: disabled).
AUTH_ENABLED=0
# Web: copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env.local, not this file.
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:8000
# Backend port: uvicorn --port 8000; web port: Vite normally 5173.
# Detector posting URL: --backend-url http://127.0.0.1:8000/update
# Model: edge/config.yaml model.stage2_path or --stage2-model.
# Expected checkpoint: acpds_cls/weights/best.pt (never commit weights).
# Windows device override: --device cpu (config currently defaults to mps).
# Alerts defaults: occupancy 80%, confidence 70%, stale 15 seconds.
# Configure alert thresholds through the Alerts UI or PUT /alerts/settings;
# these are persisted in SQLite, not read from environment variables.
# Keep owner tokens out of committed files and all VITE_* variables.
